# Biome 1, level 13 — Watershed
#
# One spring, three hubs, three arms of different length. Two arms pay 270 between them and the
# target is 450, so every hub has to be served — including the long arm, which is worth more than
# the two short ones put together are short of the goal.
#
# The board is only the arms. There is nowhere to put a conduit that is not part of an answer, which
# makes this a level about order rather than about placement: the arm a tile can reach depends on
# what has already been built.

